## Upload checklist
- [ ] DRC 0 errors, 0 unconnected
- [ ] BOM line count matches parts table; every pinned value matches "Wanted"
- [ ] Every polarised part checked in JLC 2D/3D view against datasheet and pad nets
- [ ] No copper across the break-off line
- [ ] Hash of `build/fab/` logged in `qaqc/UPLOAD_CHECKLIST.md`
